Entanglement Bonds are one of the most **structurally important** and **behavior‑shaping** components in your entire 10‑dimensional engine. If the **DecaMatrix** is the physics operator, then **Entanglement Bonds** are the *cross‑dimensional constraints* that modify that physics in real time.

